  "label": "User projected onto the text questioning belief in science and history",
  "description": "The text 'doubt science & established historical records?' is a direct rhetorical question aimed at the viewer, implying that the user is being asked to consider whether they themselves doubt established knowledge. This creates a projection where the user is being made to identify with the stereotype of being ignorant or irrational, which is then applied to the black_man_in_tuxedo. The user is projected onto the textual material that contains this accusatory question.",
